          "actionType": {
            "value": "reaction"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature gives you the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained] condition.</p><hr /><p>Your ability to twist your opponents' bodies into painful locks and holds makes you particularly adept at escaping such predicaments. Attempt an Athletics check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Escape] the triggering condition. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to this check.</p>"
