      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "running-tackle.json",
      "id": "A981119DMdqE9Pg1",
      "name": "Running Tackle",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "A981119DMdqE9Pg1",
        "folder": "bcoviuaJ3aOakfIO",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Running Tackle",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You charge, throwing your body at your foe in a vicious tackle. Stride twice or make a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.High Jump] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Long Jump], then attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Grapple] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Shove]. If you made a High Jump or Long Jump, you can make the [[/act grapple]] or [[/act shove]] at any point in the jump, but you can't travel any farther on the jump after you do.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Wrestler Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
